Dalei TV Home is original code, not a fork of FLauncher or guizang-tv.
Feature research consulted their public behavior/documentation. No source,
assets, binaries, or licenses from those projects are included here.

The visual direction is an original interpretation of a minimal console-style
interface. No Sony/PlayStation logos, assets, or official affiliation.

Android framework APIs and build tools are external dependencies. They are not
distributed in this repository; their own upstream licenses continue to apply.
